# 🏥 SkinSense AI
> **Status:** In Development (Stage 1: Vision & Prototyping) 🛠️

## 📍 Problem Statement
In rural Ranchi, dermatological care is scarce. We are building an **Offline AI tool** to help community workers identify **Psoriasis**, **Eczema**, and **Ringworm** using **TFLite**.

## 🏗️ Technical Architecture
- **AI Model:** `MobileNetV2` (currently in the fine-tuning phase).
- **Frontend:** `Flutter` (initial camera UI drafted).
- **Quantization:** Planned **INT8** to ensure the model is <5MB.

## 🗺️ Project Roadmap
- [x] **Phase 1:** Market Research & User Journey Design.
- [x] **Phase 2:** Initial Model Training in Google Colab.
- [/] **Phase 3:** Flutter App & TFLite Integration (IN PROGRESS).
- [ ] **Phase 4:** Field Testing in local health centers.
